From 094ab7ea220b181739e05ca91387759327131c7e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ji Mao Cai <44921326+jinghero@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 22:26:41 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] host IME: enqueue complete input events and handle send
 failure in the UI

Batch replacement, commit and composition frames atomically under the pipe lock. Guard UI retries with a host-only focus generation and expose backpressure as retryable. Keep failed input until explicit retry, copy recovery or discard; advance composition state only after successful enqueue. Includes production transport and UI-body fault-injection probes; real Qt/Windows/Android IME validation remains outstanding.
